flowchart LR
    subgraph clientes[Clientes]
        UI[Painel web<br/>navegador]
        A1[App 1<br/>DB Connection Checker]
        A2[App 2<br/>Env Injector]
    end
    subgraph docker[docker compose · rede vaultkit]
        GW[api-gateway<br/>:8800<br/>roteamento + registry]
        AUTH[auth-service<br/>:8801<br/>componente auth]
        SEC[secret-service<br/>:8802<br/>secrets + cache]
        AUD[audit-service<br/>:8803<br/>componente audit]
        DB[(SQLite<br/>audit.db)]
        PG[(PostgreSQL<br/>:5433)]
    end
    BAO[(OpenBao 2.7.0<br/>OrbStack :8210<br/>namespace vaultkit)]
    UI -->|HTTP/JSON| GW
    A1 -->|GatewayProvider| GW
    A2 -->|GatewayProvider| GW
    GW -->|/api/auth/*| AUTH
    GW -->|/api/secrets/* /api/list/*| SEC
    GW -->|/api/audit/*| AUD
    AUTH -->|AppRole login| BAO
    SEC -->|KV v2| BAO
    AUTH -.->|eventos| AUD
    SEC -.->|eventos| AUD
    AUD --- DB
    A1 -->|senha do cofre| PG
    A1 -. modo --direct<br/>OpenBaoProvider .-> BAO
